{
  "name": "Truncate a Text Summary via Webhook",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "truncate-text-summary-webhook-0",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "position": [
        200,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "truncate-text-summary-webhook",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "truncate-text-summary-webhook-1",
      "name": "Notas & Testes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -140,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 760,
        "height": 380,
        "content": "## Template: Resumidor com LLM (pronto para escalar)\n\n- Objetivo: Receber texto e gerar resumo com LLM ou fallback local.\n- Teste rápido:\n```bash\ncurl -X POST http://<SEU_N8N>/webhook/template/ai-summarizer \\\n -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n -d '{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Escreva um parágrafo longo aqui...\\\"}'\n```\n- Produção: habilite o nó OpenAI e configure credenciais.\n- Fallback: 'Local Summarize' funciona sem credenciais."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "truncate-text-summary-webhook-2",
      "name": "Prepare Text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "txt",
              "name": "text",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.text || 'Digite seu texto aqui para resumir.' }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "truncate-text-summary-webhook-3",
      "name": "OpenAI (opcional)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "position": [
        720,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "cachedResultName": "GPT-4O-MINI"
        },
        "options": {},
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "Resuma de forma objetiva o seguinte texto:\n\n{{ $json.text }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "disabled": true
    },
    {
      "id": "truncate-text-summary-webhook-4",
      "name": "Local Summarize",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.function",
      "position": [
        720,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "// Fallback simples: truncar e manter frases principais\nconst t = ($json.text || \"\").trim();\nif (!t) return [{ json: { summary: \"\" } }];\nconst max = 240;\nconst summary = t.length <= max ? t : t.slice(0, max) + \"...\";\nreturn [{ json: { summary } }];\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "truncate-text-summary-webhook-5",
      "name": "Respond",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "position": [
        980,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "truncate-text-summary-webhook-relay-hook",
      "name": "Open Flow relay webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        200,
        650
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "truncate-text-summary-webhook-relay",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "truncate-text-summary-webhook-forward",
      "name": "Forward complete request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        500,
        650
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://YOUR_OPENFLOW_HOST/webhook/YOUR_FLOW",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ {event: JSON.stringify($json.body)} }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "truncate-text-summary-webhook-relay-response",
      "name": "Return Open Flow response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        800,
        650
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Prepare Text",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Prepare Text": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Local Summarize",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Local Summarize": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Open Flow relay webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Forward complete request",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Forward complete request": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Return Open Flow response",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "pinData": {}
}
